CAD Agent Skills attribution
============================

This repository's skill and agent material derives in part from the public
srobroek/cad-agent and srobroek/omp-plugins repositories:

  <https://github.com/srobroek/cad-agent>
  <https://github.com/srobroek/omp-plugins>

The cad-agent project records its historical import of skill material from
omp-plugins. This project reorganizes and adapts that instruction material into
a different skill, role and record contract. It does not include cad-agent's
runnable helper scripts or tooling, or the separately attributed AgentCAD
scripts documented by cad-agent's original NOTICE files.

The full variant's material profiles cite individual supplier and standards
source documents in their `sources[].url`, `reference` and `revision` fields.
The source families include Hydro; Polymaker and Fiberon/Polymaker; Fiberlogy;
PLEXIGLAS/POLYVANTIS; Makrolon/Covestro and Exolon; Outokumpu; Salzgitter;
Ensinger; Formlabs; and ISO standards. The cited product and standard titles,
source paths, editions, access dates and conditions remain in each profile.
See [the profile README](full/skills/cad-record/assets/manufacturing/material-profiles/README.md)
for common caveats and each source field for its specific attribution. Some
sources have incomplete conditions; ISO material was accessed through
third-party previews. Profile attribution does not establish rights to
redistribute those source documents.

Attribution records provenance only. It does not change a license or infer
that every source has the same terms; consult the cited source and its
applicable terms before redistribution or use. The repository's `LICENSE`
remains as provided. This notice makes no additional relicensing claim.
Separate third-party material retains its applicable notices and licenses.
